    "ss_timeline_4_EjNL3U": {
      "type": "ss-timeline-4",
      "blocks": {
        "slide_9GVi4i": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2015",
            "text": "<p><strong>The First Candles</strong> | Light Provisions began at the end of 2015 with a makers market, a very new Instagram account, and two fragrances: Campfire and Lavender Balsam. Both are still here today.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_7693.heic",
            "image_width": 260,
            "image_ratio": "original",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "landscape"
          }
        },
        "slide_AJ8V7j": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2016",
            "text": "<p><strong>On Brand</strong> | By spring, the lighthouse logo, blue labels, and custom lettering had given the brand its first real identity, and by the end of the year our candles were being carried by shops around Colorado, including The Broadmoor.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2016_Studio_Photos_Light_Provisions_31_copy.jpg",
            "image_width": 260,
            "image_ratio": "original",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "original"
          }
        },
        "slide_tgYaEX": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2018",
            "text": "<p><strong>A glass worth keeping</strong> | We moved into heavy rocks glasses with gold rims and a hidden logo underneath, our first real attempt to make the vessel something you'd want to keep and use after the candle was gone.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/2018_LB_gold_tumbler_1_copy.jpg",
            "image_width": 260,
            "image_ratio": "original",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "portrait"
          }
        },
        "slide_L3kzPL": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2019",
            "text": "<p><strong>Growing Beyond Colorado</strong> | After years spent at makers markets, farmers markets, and holiday fairs, Light Provisions had grown from a table at local events to more than 60 retailers around the country.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_4148_copy.jpg",
            "image_width": 260,
            "image_ratio": "square",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "landscape"
          }
        },
        "slide_Jm3gL6": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2021",
            "text": "<p><strong>Starting over, on purpose</strong> | We retired the jars and rebuilt the collection around custom rippled crystal glassware, new packaging, and a simpler idea: the candle should leave you with something better than an empty candle jar.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cocktail_tumbler.jpg",
            "image_width": 260,
            "image_ratio": "portrait",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "portrait"
          }
        },
        "slide_bgTyyX": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2023",
            "text": "<p><strong>Looking beyond candles</strong> | <a href=\"/collections/tsubota-pearl\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Tsubota Pearl\">Tsubota Pearl</a> became the first outside maker carried by Light Provisions, while a small run of Special Edition candles introduced the idea that would eventually become On Rotation.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_7705.jpg",
            "image_width": 190,
            "image_ratio": "square",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "original"
          }
        },
        "slide_peD3An": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2024",
            "text": "<p><strong>Refill, without the lock-in</strong> | We introduced a <a href=\"/pages/candle-refills\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Refill Candles\">refill candle</a> designed to work with our glassware or another appropriately sized vessel you already own, extending the idea of reuse beyond Light Provisions itself.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cypress-lemon-candle-9270580.png",
            "image_width": 190,
            "image_ratio": "original",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "original"
          }
        },
        "slide_CHib8c": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "date": "2025 → Today",
            "text": "<p><strong>Made here, found elsewhere</strong> | Light Provisions has continued to grow into a mix of things I make and things I find, from candles and locally sourced glass to Japanese incense, lighters, vintage pieces, and objects chosen around the same ideas of home, warmth, light, and ritual.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/lit-tumbler-48.jpg",
            "image_width": 260,
            "image_ratio": "portrait",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "portrait"
          }
        },
        "slide_jP7fkA": {
          "type": "slide",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "date": "2020",
            "text": "<p>Add text content about <strong>a certain step</strong> your company has taken to get here</p>",
            "image_width": 200,
            "image_ratio": "square",
            "image_ratio_mobile": "square"
          }
        }
      },
